Hyun Kyung-lyul, you are number five.

807
00:39:49,095 --> 00:39:51,097
Jeong Hyun-gyu, you are number one.

808
00:39:53,224 --> 00:39:54,892
JAE JAE, you are number six.

809
00:39:55,684 --> 00:39:57,103
John Park, you are number two.

810
00:39:57,686 --> 00:39:58,896
The three of us are stuck together.

811
00:39:59,688 --> 00:40:00,815
Look how that turned out.

812
00:40:03,401 --> 00:40:04,568
The number of death.

813
00:40:04,652 --> 00:40:06,195
Jung Won-young, you are number four.

814
00:40:08,072 --> 00:40:10,074
- I'm three.
- Ha Seok-jin, you are number three.

815
00:40:10,157 --> 00:40:11,450
How did this happen?

816
00:40:11,534 --> 00:40:14,995
<i>Won-young and I ended up</i>
<i>right next to each other.</i>

817
00:40:15,079 --> 00:40:17,790
<i>If the other guys put their minds to it,</i>
<i>they can really take us down.</i>

818
00:40:17,873 --> 00:40:18,707
<i>This is bad.</i>

819
00:40:18,791 --> 00:40:20,292
- We're in trouble.
- Is this actually the setup?

820
00:40:21,043 --> 00:40:22,753
This really is like Russian Roulette.

821
00:40:22,837 --> 00:40:24,755
We will now handcuff you.

822
00:40:26,132 --> 00:40:27,591
Thank you.

823
00:40:29,969 --> 00:40:32,805
I'm suddenly super nervous.

824
00:40:32,888 --> 00:40:34,598
Good luck. Let's have a good game.

825
00:40:35,808 --> 00:40:37,393
- All right.
- There's enough to reach.

826
00:40:37,476 --> 00:40:39,437
- Yeah.
- It's more than enough.

827
00:40:39,520 --> 00:40:41,814
- So it keeps you from going far.
- Like this, huh?

828
00:40:42,398 --> 00:40:45,443
Does it make sense
for two people to get eliminated?

829
00:40:45,526 --> 00:40:47,778
How strange. We're only two days in.

830
00:40:47,862 --> 00:40:48,863
Good luck.

831
00:40:48,946 --> 00:40:49,780
Let's go!

832
00:40:50,322 --> 00:40:51,782
Round 1 will now begin.

833
00:40:52,616 --> 00:40:54,827
The first player for Round 1
is Jeong Hyun-gyu.

834
00:40:55,411 --> 00:40:57,621
Jeong Hyun-gyu, please choose an action.

835
