840
00:41:21,312 --> 00:41:22,396
Not yet.

841
00:41:23,647 --> 00:41:25,024
I think I'll have to see after a round.

842
00:41:26,942 --> 00:41:28,736
How do you wanna play this?

843
00:41:29,278 --> 00:41:31,280
The strategy that clearly comes to mind

844
00:41:32,281 --> 00:41:33,991
