877
00:43:23,517 --> 00:43:25,644
I checked E and F.

878
00:43:30,649 --> 00:43:32,818
HA SEOK-JIN
SELECT ACTION

879
00:43:32,901 --> 00:43:37,031
PRIVATE INVESTIGATION

880
00:43:37,114 --> 00:43:39,033
SELECTION COMPLETE

881
00:43:39,116 --> 00:43:40,534
PRIVATE INVESTIGATION RESULTS
HA SEOK-JIN, JUNG WON-YOUNG

882
00:43:40,618 --> 00:43:44,204
C, HA SEOK-JIN: X
D, JUNG WON-YOUNG: O

