884
00:43:47,750 --> 00:43:49,960
Jung Won-young, please choose an action.

885
00:43:52,129 --> 00:43:54,381
- I can talk ahead of my turn, right?
- Go ahead.

886
00:43:54,465 --> 00:43:56,925
- You can talk out loud or whisper.
- I wanna whisper.

887
00:43:58,010 --> 00:43:59,970
If you're gonna choose
private investigation--

888
00:44:00,054 --> 00:44:01,055
I haven't decided yet.

889
00:44:01,138 --> 00:44:02,973
- I mean--
- Feel free to recommend.

890
00:44:17,988 --> 00:44:19,990
I wanna know too. What did he say?

891
00:44:21,950 --> 00:44:23,786
I think they're…

892
00:44:23,869 --> 00:44:25,871
- Ganging up?
- Yeah, for sure.

893
00:44:25,954 --> 00:44:29,667
- That's why Kyung-lyul chose to whisper
- Four-on-two?

894
00:44:29,750 --> 00:44:31,919
- because he's sensed the shift.
- It looks like four-on-two.

895
00:44:32,002 --> 00:44:34,380
It's only natural
for the four prison members

896
00:44:34,463 --> 00:44:35,756
- to band together.
- Totally.

897
