Hyun Kyung-lyul, please choose an action.

899
00:44:49,395 --> 00:44:53,357
I checked B and C,
so you should check E and F.

900
00:44:53,440 --> 00:44:55,984
I confirmed B and C, and they're empty.

901
00:44:56,068 --> 00:44:58,821
B didn't have a bullet to start with.
Why did you check B?

902
00:44:58,904 --> 00:44:59,863
Did someone check B?

903
00:44:59,947 --> 00:45:01,281
- Were A and B revealed?
- Yeah.

904
00:45:01,365 --> 00:45:02,783
- A had one, and B didn't?
- Yeah.

905
00:45:02,866 --> 00:45:03,742
Oh, that's right.

906
00:45:04,576 --> 00:45:05,536
I made a mistake.

907
00:45:13,752 --> 00:45:15,546
I can't trust anyone here.

908
00:45:16,130 --> 00:45:17,631
He's very skeptical.

909
00:45:19,550 --> 00:45:22,094
Hyun Kyung-lyul's private action
has been completed.

910
00:45:22,177 --> 00:45:23,303
JAE JAE.

911
00:45:23,387 --> 00:45:24,346
Next, JAE JAE.

912
00:45:24,430 --> 00:45:26,640
- Please choose an action.
- If I share some intel,

913
00:45:26,724 --> 00:45:28,308
would you work with me?

914
00:45:31,854 --> 00:45:34,356
I've already acquired some intel.

915
00:45:34,440 --> 00:45:35,858
I picked it up earlier.

916
00:45:36,525 --> 00:45:38,527
Let me play a round first.

917
00:45:39,111 --> 00:45:41,155
You'll definitely benefit from this intel.

918
00:45:41,989 --> 00:45:43,741
I'll just play a round first.

919
00:45:44,241 --> 00:45:47,411
<i>He suddenly tried to</i>
<i>whisper something to me.</i>

920
00:45:47,494 --> 00:45:50,914
<i>I already received intel</i>
<i>from the other side,</i>

921
00:45:50,998 --> 00:45:53,625
<i>so I couldn't play both sides.</i>

922
00:45:56,086 --> 00:45:58,338
JAE JAE's private action
has been completed.

923
00:45:58,422 --> 00:45:59,631
Everyone's going private now.

924
00:46:00,424 --> 00:46:02,426
- That concludes Round 1.
- D.

925
00:46:03,761 --> 00:46:05,554
Round 2 will now begin.

926
00:46:05,637 --> 00:46:07,890
The first player for Round 2 is John Park.

927
00:46:09,641 --> 00:46:12,436
- The bullets are in chambers A and D.
- Okay.

928
00:46:12,519 --> 00:46:14,062
JAE JAE confirmed it.

929
00:46:16,190 --> 00:46:19,985
<i>This game is fundamentally</i>
<i>a battle of information.</i>

930
00:46:20,068 --> 00:46:21,737
<i>So it felt like</i>
<i>she was drawing a clear line</i>

931
00:46:21,820 --> 00:46:26,116
<i>when she said</i>
<i>she wouldn't accept my information.</i>

932
00:46:26,200 --> 00:46:28,535
<i>I realized how bad this could be for me.</i>

933
00:46:28,619 --> 00:46:29,661
JAE JAE.

934
00:46:30,496 --> 00:46:31,747
Do you also wanna play four-on-two?

935
00:46:31,830 --> 00:46:33,957
You're just looking to survive, right?

936
00:46:34,458 --> 00:46:37,294
- Right. It's a survival show, after all.
- So, do you not trust me?

937
00:46:37,377 --> 00:46:39,296
- I was offering you intel.
- We haven't interacted much.

938
00:46:39,379 --> 00:46:42,508
I mean, I was offering you intel.
I didn't ask for anything in return.

939
00:46:42,591 --> 00:46:44,134
- Why would you just turn it down?
- But still…

940
00:46:44,218 --> 00:46:47,387
I'd feel bad just accepting it
when I can't return the favor.

941
00:46:48,847 --> 00:46:51,767
- That's a little upsetting.
- I also find the situation very upsetting.

942
00:46:51,850 --> 00:46:54,144
I mean, that's not…

